      "created_at": "2015-02-22T22:29:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>K, thanks. &nbsp;A friend asked me this and I said something like \"I think so, but I think it should almost never come up.\" &nbsp;The very next day I had proletariat sitting at full health (thanks to heals from Legacy) with 4 duplicates with only shared burden out, and thought it had become a liability rather than a benefit. &nbsp;Also useful for Baron Blade and anybody who makes a decision when a power comes into play (Unity, Dawn, Ra, Operative, etc.).</p>",
